# Beast 3.0 Emergency Response Division

The Emergency Response & Circuit Breaker Division serves as the critical safety net of the Beast 3.0 ecosystem, capable of halting vulnerable services or overriding compromised modules instantly.

## Mission

Safeguard DAO assets, member funds, and system infrastructure through automated circuit breakers and authorized emergency response protocols.

## Core Responsibilities

- System-Wide & Modular Circuit Breakers
- Multisig Emergency Override & Freeze Protocols
- Real-Time Threat Alarms & Incident Logging
- Automatic Service Recovery & Unpause Workflows

## Connected Systems

- Cyber Security & Defense Division (`div-07-security-firewall`)
- System Orchestrator (`div-21-system-orchestrator`)
- Treasury & Revenue Division (`beast3-treasury-revenue`)

## Status

Development
